I find capitalizing syllables in the middles of words more jarring than=20
periods at the beginnings of words or apostrophes pronounced /h/. I much=20
prefer the acute accent. Lojban, though, isn't the only language that does=
=20
unusual things with capitals. Saanich is written entirely in capitals.

